 ```
 
+`removeListenersByContext` returns the number of registrations removed and
+compares stored contexts by strict identity. Listeners registered without a
+truthy context use the emitter itself as their context.
+
 ### Tests and benchmarks
 
 To run tests run `npm test`. To run the benchmarks run `npm run benchmark`.
